    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4447" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλο-δημία</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλο-δαμία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδημία</span>
			, <i>stay in foreign land</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Int.</u>
				48
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἀλλοδημίᾳ</span>
			<i>abroad</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				954e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταστρέφειν ἐπ᾽
					ἀλλοδημί&lt;ασ&gt;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Mort.</u>
					26
				</span></i>
			 : pl., <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>VP</u>
				35.252
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>concrete,
				<i>foreign people</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στείχειν ἐπ᾽ ἀλλοδαμίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					17.37
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				9.21
			</span></i>.</div>
